5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about us not speaking after this. Let's pick something that keeps the peace.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I just want a corner we can walk past without holding our breath in August.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to know the hours this takes. I refuse to guess at the workload.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,Why does one house always get the gate? I want a fair look at the burden.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must add up the costs first. No one has done the math yet.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin Fairness matters, but so does friendship. Let's find a middle ground.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,@Kenji I agree. A solution that smells bad is no solution at all.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas Exactly. If we don't know the setup cost, we can't plan.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,@Asuka Hours are part of the cost. I want to see the rotation details.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,@Shizue The smell is a symptom. The budget is the root. Let's check the ledger.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the complaint log. It shows who is actually suffering.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I want to see the station block's minutes. They built one, what happened?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the supervised mornings. I need to know the time commitment.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I will measure the frontages. If one is too small, the rotation fails.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the ward subsidy. We need to know what money is available.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
