35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The log shows one house filed eleven complaints. That is why they are angry.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The station block argued over sweeping within two years. A permanent build invites conflict.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Supervised mornings take fifty minutes. That is twenty per year. Manageable, but real.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,One frontage is only ninety centimetres wide. A rotation there is impossible.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The subsidy covers forty percent. The rest is on us. The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen yearly.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin If one house can't host it, the rotation is broken. We need a fixed spot.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,@Kenji But a fixed spot means one house suffers. The station block proved that.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,@Servas Thirty-four thousand yen is a lot for five houses. We need to reduce waste.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka If we manage the hours, we reduce the mess. But who watches?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,@Shizue The smell from the bin house was worse. An open pile is better than a sealed trap.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,@Rin We can take turns watching. It keeps us talking. It prevents the silence.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,@Kenji I like that. It keeps the community alive. But is it enough for the smell?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue If we only put out bins in a narrow window, the pavement stays clean.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,@Asuka A narrow window means waking up early. The truck comes at seven forty.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin The truck time is fixed. We must adapt to it, not fight it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
