60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option C keeps us together. We watch together. It solves the silence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option A is too risky. The station block showed how it ends. I prefer C.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option C is logical. Limited hours mean limited mess. I vote C.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option B is unfair. Option A is a trap. Option C is the only fair one.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option C balances cost and community. It is the wise choice. I vote C.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,@Shizue I agree. We need to stay friends. C does that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,@Kenji Yes. And it avoids the sealed smell. I am comfortable with C.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin The hours are tight, but fair. I accept the early start.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka If we all take turns, no one is stuck. I am in.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,@Kenji A shared burden is a shared bond. Let us proceed with C.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
